   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Compare Models\n\n1. MOSS Compare Sampler (on): SFT (A) against Base (B) with the same prompt, latent, seed and settings,\n   saved as one sheet. Plug up to four models into model_A..model_D. Each column is labelled from what\n   the model carries (its file, merge or LoRAs), not from the wiring: a Multi-LoRA switched off shows the bare model.\n   A MOSS Turbo LoRA on the turbo input applies to every column. blind shuffles and numbers the columns;\n   the key goes to info and the PNG, never onto the sheet.\n\n2. MOSS Compare Sheet (muted, right-click > Mode > Always to use): puts any images side by side,\n   here two seeds of one model, each labelled from its sampler's info or from label_A..label_D."
   ],
   "properties": {}
